            r"The normalized product $fg/r$ is a disk polynomial by the triangle inequality, and its grid numerator is $\operatorname{trunc}_0(\Re H_j/2^{p+\ell})+i\operatorname{trunc}_0(\Im H_j/2^{p+\ell})$, a shift by $p+\ell$ bits, which is $Q_p(2^{-2p}H_j/r)$ with error below $\sqrt2\,2^{-p}$; four integer products dominate the linear packing and extraction costs.",
